abstract: "A local-first desktop interface for locally managed language models and repository-grounded exploration of scientific dynamical-model repositories. Ask the Model v0.6.3 corrects qualified live GISTEMP chart admission for the reviewed current EWD snapshot and fixes chart Vala ownership declarations. It retains the v0.6.2 grounded-turn durability and fail-closed persistence boundaries."
